    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061127.0370\n\nWASHINGTON, Nov. 27 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nUrgent: Lincoln Memorial in Washington closed after suspicious items found\n\n\n\n\nThe well-known Lincoln Memorial in Washington D.C. has been closed to tourists after suspicious items were found, CNN reported on Monday.\n\nA U.S. government official said an envelope with the word \" anthrax\" on it was found at the memorial.",
